{"id":"n69448-1-9","stage":4,"title":"우기 · 雨期","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69448-1-9-1","ko":"비가 지겹게 쏟아지네.","zh":"雨一直下，真烦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"지겹게","meaning":"烦腻，厌烦","explanation":"지겹다：烦腻，厌烦；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"지겹다","audio":"/audio/11a19ae99002876c9948.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27754","senseId":"1","lemma":"지겹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지겹게","audio":"/audio/af6d9c7262207663c5e6.mp3"}},{"text":"쏟아지네.","meaning":"倾泻，下大","explanation":"쏟아지다：倾泻，下大；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"쏟아지다","audio":"/audio/f4ace1873bdada0ba5eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71284","senseId":"4","lemma":"쏟아지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쏟아지네","audio":"/audio/929f923d7afca5cecdc8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"11a19ae99002876c","term":"지겹다","zh":"烦腻，厌烦","audio":"/audio/11a19ae99002876c9948.mp3","entryId":"27754","definition":"同一状态或事情反复多次而觉得没有意思，无聊且讨厌。","pronunciation":["지겹따"]},{"id":"f4ace1873bdada0b","term":"쏟아지다","zh":"倾泻，下大","audio":"/audio/f4ace1873bdada0ba5eb.mp3","entryId":"71284","definition":"雨或雪一下子下很多，或阳光暴晒。","pronunciation":["쏘다지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/33e316691312178277e9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69448-1-9-2","ko":"우기라서 그래. 다음 달까지는 계속 비가 올걸.","zh":"现在是雨季，会一直下到下个月吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우기라서","meaning":"雨期，雨季","explanation":"우기：雨期，雨季；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"우기","audio":"/audio/e2ba23fa570f97c366a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69448","senseId":"1","lemma":"우기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우기라서","audio":"/audio/f7a60b19993a47966d20.mp3"}},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"달까지는","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달까지는","audio":"/audio/3291bddef552401eb8fa.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"올걸.","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；ㄹ걸：表示推测，或对没有做某事表示遗憾；由完整句子判断。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17"